  "html": "<div class=\"monster-afk-editor \"><div class=\"monster-afk-editor-heading\"><strong>Edit AFK Profile</strong><span class=\"monster-afk-mode-badge join\">Join Alliance rallies</span></div><section class=\"monster-afk-config-section\"><h3>Basic settings</h3><div class=\"monster-afk-basic-grid\"><label>Profile Name<input value=\"Fixture profile\"></label><label>AFK Target<select><optgroup label=\"Leaders\"><option value=\"boss\" selected=\"\">Fixture Rally Leader · Live map · Join Alliance rallies</option></optgroup></select></label></div><div class=\"monster-afk-custom-target\"><label class=\"monster-afk-check-row\"><input type=\"checkbox\">Custom target</label></div></section><section class=\"monster-afk-config-section monster-afk-join-section\"><section class=\"rally-join-settings\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"toggle-row\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" aria-label=\"Rally join conditions: Enabled\"><span>Rally join conditions</span><span class=\"ui-switch is-on\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><fieldset><div class=\"monster-afk-basic-grid\"><label class=\"monster-afk-field-wide\">Join timing<select aria-label=\"Join timing\"><option value=\"slot\">Random position</option><option value=\"delay\" selected=\"\">Random delay</option></select></label><div class=\"rally-join-range\"><label>Minimum delay (s)<input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"6000\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"1\"></label><label>Maximum delay (s)<input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"6000\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"3\"></label></div><label>Maximum wait to departure (min, 0 = unlimited)<input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\"></label><label>Rally leader list<select aria-label=\"Rally leader list\"><option value=\"off\" selected=\"\">Unrestricted</option><option value=\"blacklist\">Block listed leaders</option><option value=\"whitelist\">Only listed leaders</option></select></label></div><p class=\"muted\">Random modes pick one value per rally; equal bounds use a fixed value. Your own rallies are skipped.</p><p class=\"muted\">Start the timer when the rally is first seen. Join after the selected delay if space remains, regardless of position.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"toggle-row\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"Skip leaders with one hero: Disabled\"><span>Skip leaders with one hero</span><span class=\"ui-switch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"toggle-row\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" aria-label=\"Do not rejoin after being removed: Enabled\"><span>Do not rejoin after being removed</span><span class=\"ui-switch is-on\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></fieldset></section></section><section class=\"monster-afk-config-section\"><h3>Execution settings</h3><div class=\"monster-afk-basic-grid monster-afk-execution-grid\"><div class=\"monster-afk-squad-field\"><span>Squad Assignments</span><div class=\"monster-afk-squads\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Squad Assignments\"><button class=\"monster-afk-squad-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Squad 1\" aria-pressed=\"true\" title=\"Squad 1\">1</button><button class=\"monster-afk-squad-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Squad 2\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"Squad 2\">2</button><button class=\"monster-afk-squad-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Squad 3\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"Squad 3\">3</button><button class=\"monster-afk-squad-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Squad 4\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"Squad 4\">4</button></div></div><label title=\"Counted separately per squad after each completed attack or rally; 0 loops indefinitely\">Execution count (0 = unlimited)<input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></label></div><label class=\"monster-afk-check-row\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\">Join next rally while returning</label></section><section class=\"monster-afk-config-section\"><h3>Target filters</h3><div class=\"monster-afk-filter\"><label class=\"monster-afk-check-row\"><input type=\"checkbox\">Limit level</label></div><div class=\"monster-afk-filter\"><label class=\"monster-afk-check-row\"><input type=\"checkbox\">Limit distance</label></div></section></div>",
